# Normalise line endings for text, and let Git detect what is binary. A bare `* text eol=lf` also
# matches images: a checkout then rewrites the CRLF bytes inside their data and leaves every tree dirty.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Name the binary types anyway, so the intent survives an edit to the rule above, and so `git diff`
# reports these files as binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
